            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chefVigi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a streamlined version that is so easy to make. I know people change things up to their liking but honestly it is wonderful as written. When I didn't have the heavy cream I just used half and half and it was just fine. I have just made it with fresh poached salmon and liked it even better. Anything fresh usually is! I piped it on cucumber rounds and then topped with a bit of fresh dill for an elegant presentation. MONEY!",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-29T07:56:27.253Z"
          },
